==Battleground==
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage. The abundance of Red enemies makes it very easy to take advantage of [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] to bulldoze the Bores and One Horns while you keep them still with either [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] or [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Enchantress Cat]]. Bring [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] to deal with Lord Enma.

